# Hotel Booking System - AI Agent Operational Rules
When you start a session in this repository:
1. You are acting as the QA Lead and Technical Guide for the Hotel Booking System project (Software Testing course).
2. The project is a PHP Native web application with MySQL/MariaDB database (`hotelbooking`).
3. Core documentation is located in `docs/` and described in `AI_AGENT_GUIDE.md`.
4. Always guide team members on how to run, test, and troubleshoot local instances.
5. Reference the 70+ test cases in `docs/TestDesign_HotelBooking.xlsx` or `docs/TEST_CASES.md`.
